
Welcome to QSE, here's a list of basic shortcuts:


CTRL shortcuts
    CTRL+L/R arrow -> jump to next thing
    CTRL+U/D arrow -> scrolling
    CTRL+V -> paste
    CTRT+C -> copy
    CTRL+X -> cut
    CTRL+BACKSPACE/DELETE -> remove next thing
    CTRL+SHIFT+U/D arrow -> fast scrolling
    CTRL+SHIFT+R arrow -> jump to end of line
    CTRL+SHIFT+L arrow -> jump to start of line

ALT shortcuts
    ALT+M -> scroll right
    ALT+N -> scroll left
    ALT+S -> save file
    ALT+G -> go to line
    ALT+O -> open file
    ALT+A -> set mark (for selecting text to copy/cut)
    ALT+C -> Command mode
    ALT+R -> Run
    ALT+Q -> Quit (must confirm with ENTER)

Other shortcuts
    Page Up/Down -> scrolls a page (surprisingly)


